        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Dear Brandon,</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for bringing this to our attention. I want to assure you that we have multiple backups in place to address any data issues. Our team is currently investigating the situation and will provide you with an update as soon as possible.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Sara</div><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"2\">\n<div><br></div>\n<div>---<br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/23982/f72d0ec263baf487\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/23982/f72d0ec263baf487\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/23982/f72d0ec263baf487</a>\n</div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: support@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div><div>\n<br><br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Monday, September 9, 2024 at 5:23:34 PM, Brandon Mcdaniel wrote:<br><br><div>\n<p>Hello Amin or Omid,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>We got on our study (ID 3867) this morning to check Avicenna data quality and all of the participants show Last Recorded Data Time of Dec 31, 1969 19:00!</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>What is happening? This is an ongoing study, so this has us very worried that something has happened to all of our study data.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Did our data get deleted?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Is there a way to recover the data?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>We also have participants in the middle of the study, so if there is something going on this then this would be destroying our study integrity and data collection at the moment.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>What about all our participants who are currently enrolled in the study and we were collecting data on them?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Thank you for your assistance.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#333333;\">Brandon T. McDaniel, PhD</span></b></p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#0da314;\">Parkview Health</span></b><span style=\"color:#333333;\"> | Senior </span><span style=\"color:#262626;\">Research Scientist</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#262626;\">Health Services &amp; Informatics Research</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#262626;\">Mirro Center for Research &amp; Innovation</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#262626;\">10622 Parkview Plaza Drive, Fort Wayne, IN 46845</span></p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#262626;\">Office Phone</span></b><span style=\"color:#262626;\">: 260.266.7247</span></p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#262626;\">Website:</span></b><span style=\"color:#262626;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.parkview.com/mirro-center/hsir/health-services-informatics-research\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.parkview.com/mirro-center/hsir/health-services-informatics-research\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">Parkview Research</span></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div><br><br>",
